  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 6410285056
    m_Localized: 'My dearest Aisha, I understand the situation you are going through,
      and you know how difficult this is for me, too.


      But I cannot leave
      you alone right now, for your own good.


      I will be sending servants
      to the top of the tower to take care of you for a while. Until then, stay put
      and wait. I don''t want any more surprises, understood?


      Everything
      is going to be alright.


      Love,

      Dad'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29340545024
    m_Localized: 'Maybe I went a bit overboard with the jewelry box password, so
      just to be safe, in case I forget, here is a riddle that only I can decipher:

      

      "The
      first is the one that <b>is only present</b> in just one of them"

      

      "In
      the middle, <b>the number</b> of my favorites"

      

      "Lastly, <b>the
      shape that resembles</b> my father''s name"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
